WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.978
Open where the rider belongs: Connect Bike for a new rider, and The Class for

00:00:06.978 --> 00:00:08.077
everyone else.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.348
A new rider has no remembered bike and no finished ride. Opening the app takes them

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:20.130
straight to Connect Bike. The choice is read from the device before anything is

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.730
drawn, so The Class never shows first.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.352
In a browser that cannot reach a bike, a new rider still lands on Connect Bike,

00:00:30.352 --> 00:00:31.515
which says why.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.329
A rider who has paired a bike opens on The Class, whether or not the bike is

00:00:40.329 --> 00:00:44.635
connected. With the bike switched off, the header reads No bike, and the start

00:00:44.635 --> 00:00:46.646
button reads Connect your bike.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.625
Switch the bike on, and it reconnects as soon as it advertises, with no chooser.

00:00:56.625 --> 00:01:01.443
Only its name and the browser's identifier are kept, on the device. Pairing a

00:01:01.443 --> 00:01:03.433
different bike replaces it.

00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:10.092
Where a new rider starts, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:22.633
The tests came first. Five failed, as expected; thirteen passed at once, on the code

00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:27.651
carried over. Now two hundred and forty-four specs and one thousand three hundred

00:01:27.651 --> 00:01:29.996
and eighty-three unit tests pass.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:38.568
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:38.568 --> 00:01:39.764
nothing else.

00:01:40.109 --> 00:01:45.061
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:45.061 --> 00:01:50.073
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:01:50.073 --> 00:01:53.574
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:01:53.919 --> 00:01:57.895
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
